            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Smarter tasks, lighter on your Mac.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.12</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Jarvis now uses newer Claude models for finding tasks, writing your Focus line and reading email and meetings.</li>
  <li>Rules you type, like "anything from Anna is urgent", now reliably raise that person's tasks.</li>
  <li>A note with two tasks in it now keeps both.</li>
  <li>The on-device AI engine is paused for now, so Jarvis no longer downloads a large model.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
